-- title:
--   Local affine-response programs and finite draws
-- statement:
--   These programs compute the finite profiles and response coefficients required by local affine calibration. They implement reference and inverse-response tables, tuple enumeration, root-group and background profiles, and finite probability draws. The data representations separate the finite encoded objects from their ideal rational or real interpretations.
-- source:
--   Companion Lean implementation for the fixed-family Gaussian affine transport theorem. The source modules and their SHA-256 hashes are recorded in the checked extraction manifest. This exact generated file has SHA-256 dd963e80a5b8529ba4d3d861c87a15dcb281d796f1031e23995720bf5593bf7a. Source modules: Integration9_9_TM2NativeAveragedSlice, Integration9_9_TM2NativeProfile, Integration9_9_TM2NativeMarkedKernel, Integration9_9_TM2NativeAnchor, Integration9_9_TM2NativeBody, Integration9_9_TM2NativePrimary, Integration9_9_TM2PolynomialBudget, Integration9_9_TM2NativeFullResponseCounts, Integration9_9_TM2NativeReferenceTables, Integration9_9_TM2NativeFirstInverse, Integration9_9_TM2NativeDensityInverseColumn, Integration9_9_TM2NativeTupleEnumeration, Integration9_9_TM2NativeRootGroupAlgebra, Integration9_9_TM2NativeRootGroupProfiles, Integration9_9_TM2NativeRootGroupGaussian, Integration9_9_TM2NativeRootGroupRoles, Integration9_9_TM2NativeBackgroundProfiles, Integration9_9_TM2NativeBackgroundAlgebra, Integration9_9_TM2NativeFiniteDraw. Alternate sparse native dependencies preserve the original non-import body bytes and all public types; this header-only packaging is recorded in sparse_live/manifest.json. Current source SHA256 0bff6efd0e607e3a9ff3d2b56bc1e0a039ffd51cfd2ea818144dace85af30ff6. Native10/11 split fallback keeps every original scope-closed data body unchanged and retains the canonical module names as import facades. Current source SHA256 0bff6efd0e607e3a9ff3d2b56bc1e0a039ffd51cfd2ea818144dace85af30ff6.

