/-! Actual fixed-order joint source-word enumeration. The palette is a real
input list, and each tuple is materialized by real cons/map/flatMap machines.
The semantic proof reindexes exactly the finite tuple sum used by the native
packed-root response, without expanding a binary count into an unbounded loop. -/
namespace Integration9_9.TM2NativeTupleEnumeration
open AFT AFT.RationalNumerics AFT.BinaryArithmetic
